  "difficulty": 4,
  "answer": [
    {
      "label": "(2-a) 求表示矩阵A",
      "steps": [
        "计算基向量在$T$下的像：$T(1) = 1$，$T(x) = 2 + 3x$，$T(x^2) = (2+3x)^2 = 4 + 12x + 9x^2$",
        "写出坐标：$T(1) = 1 \\cdot 1 + 0 \\cdot x + 0 \\cdot x^2$，$T(x) = 2 \\cdot 1 + 3 \\cdot x + 0 \\cdot x^2$，$T(x^2) = 4 \\cdot 1 + 12 \\cdot x + 9 \\cdot x^2$",
        "因此表示矩阵为 $A = \\begin{pmatrix} 1 & 2 & 4 \\\\ 0 & 3 & 12 \\\\ 0 & 0 & 9 \\end{pmatrix}$"
      ]
    },
    {
      "label": "(2-b) 求特征值",
      "steps": [
        "矩阵$A$为上三角矩阵，其特征值为对角线元素：$\\lambda_1 = 1, \\lambda_2 = 3, \\lambda_3 = 9$",
        "线性变换$T$的特征值与矩阵$A$的特征值相同：$\\lambda_1 = 1, \\lambda_2 = 3, \\lambda_3 = 9$"
      ]
    }
  ],
